## Manual Verification Outcomes

The reviewer flagged unattested `### Manual Verification` bullets. Re-running automated commands does NOT attest a manual bullet. For each flagged bullet, describe in your fix output what you actually observed when you executed it: steps, command output snippets, UI state. "Manual check, looks fine" is not evidence.

If the bullet is genuinely out-of-environment (production-only, physical device, mutates real user state), do not invent an observation — state the gap and its downstream owner in your fix output so the reviewer can judge it.

